  <data key="d0">Academic Source Citation (footer)</data>
  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">This footer provides a bibliographic citation for the slide content, referencing the textbook 'Technische Mechanik 1' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2016, Springer Vieweg). It attributes the preceding academic material on technical mechanics and establishes the foundational literature used for the lecture.</data>
