<node id="Page Number 27 (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page Number 27 (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number 27, acting as a structural navigation marker. It locates the continuation of a section on Mohr's Circle (Mohrscher Spannungskreis), specifically part b) of an example calculating normal and shear stresses at a 30-degree angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a7d19da473048f7577c45363a2702e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a7f9fd51bacb1b5261081565de649fc</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
