<node id="Elastostatik">
  <data key="d0">Elastostatik</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The field of mechanics concerned with the study of elastic bodies under static loading conditions, encompassing the topics covered in Chapter 10.&lt;SEP&gt;The field of elastostatics, a branch of mechanics dealing with elastic behavior of bodies under static loads, providing the context for the technical diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;A field of study concerning the behavior of elastic solids under forces, encompassing concepts like Young's modulus and yield point.&lt;SEP&gt;A field of mechanics focusing on the elastic behavior of loaded bodies, covered in Chapter 11 regarding stress states.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic covered in Technische Mechanik 2 and 3 and the associated literature.&lt;SEP&gt;The subject area, also known as Elastostatics, for which the learning objectives and educational framework are established.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0e3f83f75ba130c72c201a9b9da1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cebf917adc3d92ce2d5e155d10154396&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bb8c329536d2e721390485300fec34e&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-670b9f1f19f1e0b4092b30f27469ebb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18872f44af51f12eed1b7bb9c974c8d</data>
