<node id="Technische Mechanik 2">
  <data key="d0">Technische Mechanik 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">"Technische Mechanik 2" is an established, authoritative German-language textbook focused on engineering mechanics. Published in its 13th edition in 2017 by Springer Vieweg, the volume was authored by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall. It serves as Volume 2 (Band 2) of a widely recognized, multi-volume mechanics series. Functioning as a standard reference and primary source material for technical mechanics lectures, it is an essential resource in university-level mechanical engineering education and a well-known standard work in the German engineering curriculum.

The textbook provides a comprehensive exploration of elastostatics, continuum mechanics, hydrostatics, and the strength of materials. It systematically presents theoretical principles, mathematical formulas, and experimental methodologies to explain a wide array of foundational and advanced engineering concepts. Core topics include mechanical stress (Spannung), strain, elasticity, kinematics, Hooke's Law, and constitutive laws. By combining theoretical frameworks with practical structural mechanics examples, the text offers a cohesive guide to the fundamental principles of technical mechanics.

A significant portion of the book is dedicated to detailed stress analysis and continuum mechanics concepts. This includes an in-depth examination of stress vectors, stress tensors (such as the component analysis detailed in Chapter 11.1), normal stresses, and shear stresses. The text extensively covers plane stress states, coordinate transformations, tensor properties, stress state invariants, and hydrostatic stress states. Furthermore, it thoroughly explores stress transformation theory, principal stresses, maximum shear stress, equilibrium conditions, and Mohr's stress circle, including its special cases and mathematical applications.

Beyond continuum mechanics, "Technische Mechanik 2" delves deeply into structural mechanics and applied engineering problems. It features comprehensive sections on structural design, cross-section analysis, and truss analysis. The textbook provides a rigorous analysis of statically determinate and indeterminate bar systems (Stabsysteme), detailing displacement analysis, calculation methods, and alternative solution techniques. Additionally, it includes applied methodologies such as thin-walled pressure vessel stress analysis, ensuring students and practitioners are equipped with both the theoretical knowledge and practical tools required for advanced engineering challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e05e8f931eaf44276170a34134cf8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71dad38576055c6e013578d06064a913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17dfe04089064853421a9f1af5f1cb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c527b23d18394e188c355b1b1185acec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7d98bfb03bb42a21ae886e54257cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2ecbe17c739fbd7bdf88a5cb116b3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7acbcd6b20eaf7e62181f096df8a5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e808a43e592e78037efdbadafb6d692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3cdf7e6c0e0814f6340adcf0330c36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10de6334f28b94ed6f4ea9af906f66c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7191762e3c837260ad5bf3f1bc50f25a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad3e7d061ebaf26776716772bd7daeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd72d98943d7e0523296223aa7032d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd50f7cb97e77515d873719c81dafca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b35bef5073db0c5a31b6dd2e83c0ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f99cae1296009661e572167acf5fe19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3118530638f20d2b532ee5ac5df3f9a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f04350734b994ec6a731daabee6c318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a7b2afc01b89dc35586063ca901c7f&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a6756f3e11958caa7f25916a94bb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be68185d5f9be3b57dbcc2d1f774fbb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61ee301f89076e345159fdaef391ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf5f754cbb16f87120d0c3bf0cd2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff4ce898bbbc110abe830de75521c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5db8101dd80f03fc824342c78093902c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e0e1d2a168869746758dfc06077ca50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-670b9f1f19f1e0b4092b30f27469ebb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec30ad8072c74dbe906914b85d9353a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5bec24cc4d96b66479607814f58f26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f868d6a430faab3f01aae01801aa90be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3186598e4d31ef04b0826dc0b3dad17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ea2012f708d083bcf1f8357bfab292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80068bee1bee4c2ec1a3ff3d5d6d4f71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d212905be253e446a02b9ce4b7ba85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac1dafe6c2621a4fb3a412b3493553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ffd7059b21365543021b6e1a5ac8087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379e0ab80e418646d3bbaa7c2a022894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eaae8681c23616569341d164404cba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1daacc45ca5900ab841904f26a5061a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0139ebf1c