<node id="Thermal Expansion Law">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Expansion Law</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The equation Δl = α_T · ΔT · l representing the thermal expansion behavior (Wärmeausdehnungsgesetz) of a prismatic bar, a fundamental constitutive relationship in structural mechanics</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a371746d42ee15c97ccf2f983b9237ee</data>
