</node>
<node id="Coefficient Of Linear Thermal Expansion">
  <data key="d0">Coefficient Of Linear Thermal Expansion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The material property (α_T) used to calculate thermal strain.&lt;SEP&gt;Denoted as α_T, a material-specific scalar quantity with units [1/K] that determines how much a material expands per unit of temperature change&lt;SEP&gt;The material property alpha_T that determines the thermal strain component for a given temperature change.&lt;SEP&gt;A material property denoted as αT that characterizes the free thermal expansion of the heated rod segment per unit temperature change.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a371746d42ee15c97ccf2f983b9237ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f197243eeecfe8da4e162edc85af353&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc3cadf3a789dbb882aa778366ab3b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb28b0e78717850205497e7c5e164dc</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784896966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hauger">
  <data key="d0">Hauger</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hauger is an academic author recognized for significant contributions to the field of engineering mechanics literature. Operating from an objective standpoint within technical academia, Hauger has established a prominent presence through collaborative authorship in the widely recognized "Technische Mechanik" textbook series. These academic publications are frequently recommended as essential resources in engineering curricula, where they are utilized to explicitly outline and achieve expected educational outcomes for students studying technical mechanics.

Most notably, Hauger is credited as one of the four co-authors of the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2," which was published by Springer Vieweg in the year 2017. Furthermore, Hauger's collaborative footprint extends to the specific co-authorship of the 13th edition of "Technische Mechanik 2: Elastostatik," as well as the 14th edition of "Technische Mechanik 3." In addition to these subsequent volumes, Hauger is also acknowledged as an author of the preceding textbook in the series, "Technische Mechanik 1." Through these comprehensive collaborative works, Hauger has demonstrated a sustained and integral involvement across multiple foundational volumes of this prominent engineering textbook series.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e05e8f931eaf44276170a34134cf8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71dad38576055c6e013578d06064a913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17dfe04089064853421a9f1af5f1cb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c527b23d18394e188c355b1b1185acec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7d98bfb03bb42a21ae886e54257cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2ecbe17c739fbd7bdf88a5cb116b3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7acbcd6b20eaf7e62181f096df8a5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e808a43e592e78037efdbadafb6d692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3cdf7e6c0e0814f6340adcf0330c36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10de6334f28b94ed6f4ea9af906f66c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7191762e3c837260ad5bf3f1bc50f25a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad3e7d061ebaf26776716772bd7daeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd72d98943d7e0523296223aa7032d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42f0665902c9df9b5ec4573eb02f74a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd50f7cb97e77515d873719c81dafca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b35bef5073db0c5a31b6dd2e83c0ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f99cae1296009661e572167acf5fe19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3118530638f20d2b532ee5ac5df3f9a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f04350734b994ec6a731daabee6c318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a7b2afc01b89dc35586063ca901c7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a6756f3e11958caa7f25916a94bb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be68185d5f9be3b57dbcc2d1f774fbb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61ee301f89076e345159fdaef391ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf5f754cbb16f87120d0c3bf0cd2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff4ce898bbbc110abe830de75521c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5db8101dd80f03fc824342c78093902c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e0e1d2a168869746758dfc06077ca50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec30ad8072c74dbe906914b85d9353a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5bec24cc4d96b66479607814f58f26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f868d6a430faab3f01aae01801aa90be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3186598e4d31ef04b0826dc0b3dad17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ea2012f708d083bcf1f8357bfab292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80068bee1bee4c2ec1a3ff3d5d6d4f71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d212905be253e446a02b9ce4b7ba85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac1dafe6c2621a4fb3a412b3493553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ffd7059b21365543021b6e1a5ac8087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379e0ab80e418646d3bbaa7c2a022894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eaae8681c23616569341d164404cba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1daacc45ca5900ab841904f26a5061a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0139ebf1ce9f9e12ac7fedf1b939a2f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56ba60dee95d9f51