  <data key="d5">1784904048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mechanical Engineering">
  <data key="d0">Mechanical Engineering</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A field of engineering where the thermal expansion law is essential for analyzing thermal stresses in pipeline systems and other applications&lt;SEP&gt;A field of engineering in which the equilibrium equation is essential for analyzing axially loaded members under body forces or surface tractions.&lt;SEP&gt;A field of engineering focused on the design and analysis of mechanical systems, representing the broader context of the page's educational content.&lt;SEP&gt;An engineering field where stress transformation is used extensively for stress analysis of loaded components&lt;SEP&gt;An engineering discipline identified as the broader technical context for the provided text, alongside physics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a371746d42ee15c97ccf2f983b9237ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc011b4f71d9c304cbdecd2839b81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad3e7d061ebaf26776716772bd7daeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3780797c1d45f39538f2b68c98e007f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b47aa4fc45ad067947c357da574f854</data>
