<node id="Schröder">
  <data key="d0">Schröder</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Schröder is an academic author widely recognized for contributing to foundational educational textbooks in the field of engineering mechanics. Most notably, Schröder is identified as one of the four co-authors of the academic textbook "Technische Mechanik 2." This prominent publication, which serves as a recommended resource for students, was published in 2017 by the academic publishing house Springer Vieweg.

Beyond the second volume, Schröder's authorship extends to the broader textbook series. Specifically, Schröder is credited as a co-author of both the preceding installment, "Technische Mechanik 1," and the subsequent volume, "Technische Mechanik 3." Furthermore, Schröder has co-written formula collections that are utilized as exercise materials within the Technische Mechanik curriculum. Through these extensive collaborative efforts, Schröder has played a significant role in developing comprehensive academic resources for the study of technical mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e05e8f931eaf44276170a34134cf8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71dad38576055c6e013578d06064a913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17dfe04089064853421a9f1af5f1cb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c527b23d18394e188c355b1b1185acec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7d98bfb03bb42a21ae886e54257cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2ecbe17c739fbd7bdf88a5cb116b3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7acbcd6b20eaf7e62181f096df8a5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e808a43e592e78037efdbadafb6d692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3cdf7e6c0e0814f6340adcf0330c36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10de6334f28b94ed6f4ea9af906f66c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7191762e3c837260ad5bf3f1bc50f25a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad3e7d061ebaf26776716772bd7daeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd72d98943d7e0523296223aa7032d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42f0665902c9df9b5ec4573eb02f74a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd50f7cb97e77515d873719c81dafca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b35bef5073db0c5a31b6dd2e83c0ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f99cae1296009661e572167acf5fe19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3118530638f20d2b532ee5ac5df3f9a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f04350734b994ec6a731daabee6c318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a7b2afc01b89dc35586063ca901c7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a6756f3e11958caa7f25916a94bb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be68185d5f9be3b57dbcc2d1f774fbb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61ee301f89076e345159fdaef391ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf5f754cbb16f87120d0c3bf0cd2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff4ce898bbbc110abe830de75521c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5db8101dd80f03fc824342c78093902c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e0e1d2a168869746758dfc06077ca50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec30ad8072c74dbe906914b85d9353a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5bec24cc4d96b66479607814f58f26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f868d6a430faab3f01aae01801aa90be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3186598e4d31ef04b0826dc0b3dad17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ea2012f708d083bcf1f8357bfab292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80068bee1bee4c2ec1a3ff3d5d6d4f71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d212905be253e446a02b9ce4b7ba85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac1dafe6c2621a4fb3a412b3493553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ffd7059b21365543021b6e1a5ac8087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379e0ab80e418646d3bbaa7c2a022894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eaae8681c23616569341d164404cba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1daacc45ca5900ab841904f26a5061a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0139ebf1ce9f9e12ac7fedf1b939a2f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56ba60dee95d9f5127479d5f80c141c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-165c1196600ad5f85ab89d1be16e9bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dead11f22d1654614fa266e394b63218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e5f0e058d84e9de59b337c2234e2ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0f20e6bdef6f836f08f3407dd794183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac4ea6191b5ef268551e8e517a153c48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4458fd6aa3d97daacfd8c6846d26b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e3cdc6151a0814d04d2cc632b0969f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-350755d5c7a3a740e91d107394468b5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44965262ad3a19924f66261ac5694c5</data>
