<node id="Bar Axis">
  <data key="d0">Bar Axis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A foundational structural element defined as the connecting line of cross-section centroids in bars, introduced as part of Section 10.1 Spannung.&lt;SEP&gt;The central longitudinal axis of a straight bar, also referred to as Stabachse, along which the external axial load's line of action coincides.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b47064af1c6b2b2b7fb34a9c6b98111d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61bee0456fb356f553c6809b0f9fb7ef</data>
