<node id="l">
  <data key="d0">l</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The total length of the conical bar [m].&lt;SEP&gt;Length of the bar segment over which the distributed load acts and the normal forces are evaluated&lt;SEP&gt;The length of the bar, used in computing the distributed load and specifying boundary conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A variable representing the total length of the bar.&lt;SEP&gt;The length of the hanging rod, used to define the position of the free end and in weight calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;The original length of the bar&lt;SEP&gt;Original length of the bar element</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b5a4dfb0ae1aefebcb3a9f19f155c76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc011b4f71d9c304cbdecd2839b81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b87724a453e2805522671a76c088ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-370a72fe18982a27d4543ffa0c4c20f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213cdd3f8f32396583dc5a4fa4d54dfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542bf3a4290d267cd5257b52563c594f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faaf238bf3e3a6116edca46159e939df</data>
