  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Also known as Kerben, geometric features in structural members where non-uniform stress distributions and stress concentrations occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Structural geometric features or discontinuities in a component where stress concentration phenomena are known to occur, representing design considerations in mechanical engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Geometric features in engineering components where stress concentrations occur.</data>
