  <data key="d2">An external applied load represented as a vertical vector pointing directly downwards from node C&lt;SEP&gt;A vertical external force vector pointing directly downwards, acting on joint C&lt;SEP&gt;The external force applied to the three-bar structural system at node K.&lt;SEP&gt;The external force acting on the three-bar system at node K, represented as F in the equilibrium condition equation.&lt;SEP&gt;A significant external vertical tensile load applied at Node K, represented by a bold red downward-pointing vector arrow.&lt;SEP&gt;An external force acting on Node K, represented by a red arrow pointing vertically downwards.</data>
