<node id="Bar 3">
  <data key="d0">Bar 3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An inclined structural bar within the three-bar system, symmetric to Bar 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Symmetrically inclined structural bar at angle α relative to the central bar, pinned at its upper end to the ceiling and at its lower end to node K.&lt;SEP&gt;A bar in the three-bar system that is symmetric to Bar 1, satisfying S₁ = S₃ and EA₁ = EA₃.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural bar symmetrically arranged at angle α from the vertical axis, carrying internal axial force S₃, in the three-bar structural system.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural element suspended from the fixed support on the right, inclined symmetrically towards the center.&lt;SEP&gt;An inclined bar in the three-bar system symmetric to bar 1, with axial stiffness EA3 equal to EA1 due to symmetry.&lt;SEP&gt;An inclined bar in the three-bar truss system, oriented at angle α relative to the horizontal axis, with axial rigidity EA₃ equal to EA₁.</data>
