</node>
<node id="Displacement u(x)">
  <data key="d0">Displacement u(x)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A kinematic quantity whose integration and fields are discussed in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Kinematic quantity used to define strain ε, representing spatial displacement within the material&lt;SEP&gt;The displacement field along a rod element, related to strain through kinematics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d7acbcd6b20eaf7e62181f096df8a5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b8532cdf159a4bfe5be48dea8b78e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e2db8e0cc453f4ff50201dc37d1fa0c</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
