  <data key="d0">Chapter 10.4</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A section in a German engineering mechanics textbook covering 'Einzelstab' (single bar/rod analysis), containing the example problem of a hanging bar under self-weight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc79c4ab764f023bc17eed0dd0b44b48</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
