<node id="Dx">
  <data key="d0">Dx</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical notation representing a differential length or infinitesimal distance, rendered in green font, used in calculus-based derivations of mechanical properties to define local strain.&lt;SEP&gt;The infinitesimal width of the rectangular mechanical element, measured in the horizontal x-direction of the 2D Cartesian coordinate system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cebf917adc3d92ce2d5e155d10154396&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36eb7e02adf94546ad8999d1636f68fa</data>
