</node>
<node id="Stabelement">
  <data key="d0">Stabelement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A rod element representing an infinitesimal segment of a one-dimensional object such as a rod or bar, visually depicted in the technical diagram and serving as the basis for defining local strain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cebf917adc3d92ce2d5e155d10154396</data>
