  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A section titled "Statically Indeterminate Bar Systems" within the lecture material on structural mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;A section of the German Engineering Mechanics Textbook covering statically indeterminate bar systems, containing a worked example of a three-bar system with axial rigidities EA₁, EA₂, EA₃ = EA₁.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5d7eea8f9e0a901768256832130203b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3891c97c9b24173fa3943bf0d59b8fa9</data>
