  <data key="d0">Statically Indeterminate Structural System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A structural system whose support reactions cannot be determined by static equilibrium alone.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural system composed of three bars analyzed for forces and displacements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cdfa6405eb28772fd593fe970821beaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e6428916bed03d77d29954942400a6f</data>
