  <data key="d2">A chapter in a German-language technical mechanics document that contains Section 10.1 on mechanical stress theory, bridging continuum mechanics principles with structural dimensioning methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;A chapter in the engineering mechanics document covering tension/compression members, including stress-strain relationships, material models, and bar element analysis.</data>
