<node id="Cauchy's Stress Concept">
  <data key="d0">Cauchy's Stress Concept</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A theoretical foundation of mechanical stress introduced by Cauchy, defining the concept of stress within the framework of continuum mechanics. It was presented as a theoretical basis in the earlier occurrence of the section.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65c0da2a284b623237194f0ea10b2b73</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
