</node>
<node id="Displacement Function">
  <data key="d0">Displacement Function</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The function u(x) describing the deformation of the rod along its length, whose first derivative u'(x) represents the axial strain ε(x).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6e4242a538dfbd7e7ae0462ee78fbc7</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Top Support">
  <data key="d0">Top Support</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The fixed point at the top of the rod (x = 0) where displacement is zero (u(0) = 0) and the internal axial force is at its maximum.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6e4242a538dfbd7e7ae0462ee78fbc7</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Governing Differential Equation">
  <data key="d0">Governing Differential Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The equation for axial deformation of bars, derived by combining the differential form with kinematic and elasticity laws.&lt;SEP&gt;The mathematical equation combining constitutive relations and equilibrium conditions to determine the structural behavior of the rod.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6e4242a538dfbd7e7ae0462ee78fbc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f862d3f8b712d95184fc656859d1e6cd</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compatibility Equation Δl₁ = Δl₂ Cos α">
  <data key="d0">Compatibility Equation Δl₁ = Δl₂ Cos α</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A compatibility equation used in solving the three-bar system, relating the elongations of bars 1 and 2 through the cosine of angle α.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3891c97c9b24173fa3943bf0d59b8fa9</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vertical Displacement Δl₂">
  <data key="d0">Vertical Displacement Δl₂</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The vertical displacement associated with bar 2 of the three-bar system, determined as part of the solution steps on page 25.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3891c97c9b24173fa3943bf0d59b8fa9</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bar Forces S₁,₃">
  <data key="d0">Bar Forces S₁,₃</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The forces in bars 1 and 3 of the three-bar system, determined as part of the solution steps on page 25.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3891c97c9b24173fa3943bf0d59b8fa9</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784897007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
