<node id="N = -B = -C">
  <data key="d0">N = -B = -C</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical equation expressing the relationship between internal normal force N and support reactions B and C, indicating that the normal force is compressive.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a93c57c2e2028051403eda908d55fe3</data>
