  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The internal normal force acting on the left face of the infinitesimal element, labeled as N in the diagram, representing the normal force at that cross-section.&lt;SEP&gt;The internal axial force in the statically indeterminate bar, which is constant throughout its length and compressive due to constrained thermal expansion.&lt;SEP&gt;The compressive normal force induced in the rod due to constrained thermal expansion, which is represented by F_x.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a93c57c2e2028051403eda908d55fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f0f3e4c4e1775f77972c4268710cbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed4c24e6b357be46b6c720d32cdb5f62</data>
