<node id="Force Method">
  <data key="d0">Force Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Also known as Kraftgrößenverfahren, it is a method for solving statically indeterminate problems by supplementing equilibrium with compatibility conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Alternative solution method (Kraftgrößenverfahren) using superposition of a statically determinate '0'-system (pure thermal expansion) and a '1'-system (unit load)&lt;SEP&gt;A structural analysis technique (Kraftgrößenverfahren) for solving statically indeterminate problems.</data>
