  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Principle allowing decomposition of total strain into independent mechanical and thermal components: ε = σ/E + αT·ΔT&lt;SEP&gt;An alternative solution method decomposing the thermal loading problem into a free-expansion case (state 0) and a force-correcting case (state 1).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ab72d2dd30449c995d80393a0354227&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed4c24e6b357be46b6c720d32cdb5f62</data>
