<node id="Generalized Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d0">Generalized Hooke's Law</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The constitutive equation of linear elasticity theory that describes the relationship between stress and strain tensors.&lt;SEP&gt;A constitutive principle relating stress and strain, extended here to include thermal effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a093ad0a488172322e66eed43c540981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7f547ed992922c6608475aa607ecc95</data>
