  <data key="d0">Poisson's Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A parameter equivalent to the Lamé parameters when paired with Young's modulus for isotropic materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Commonly denoted as 'v' or ν (Querkontraktionszahl in German), representing the transverse strain ratio in elasticity theory.</data>
