</node>
<node id="Unloading (Entlastung)">
  <data key="d0">Unloading (Entlastung)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of removing load from the material, represented by a green line pointing downwards and running parallel to the initial linear elastic slope.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73a8a17ee36ec3a25041cb22c3b85cd5</data>
