  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Also known as Einzelstab analysis, it is the context in which the generalized Hooke's law for thermoelasticity is applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb28b0e78717850205497e7c5e164dc</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
