  <data key="d0">Unconstrained System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A structural system free to deform, where thermal expansion produces elongation without additional stress.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7f547ed992922c6608475aa607ecc95</data>
