<node id="Infinitesimal Triangle">
  <data key="d0">Infinitesimal Triangle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A geometric element of a specific thickness cut out from the disk to establish equilibrium in the η and ξ directions during coordinate transformation&lt;SEP&gt;A diagrammatic concept used for stress analysis, specifically mentioned as being discussed in the document.</data>
