  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Special case 2 of Mohr's stress circle: a state of pure shear stress, represented by a stress matrix with zero normal stresses and equal shear stresses τ₀.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003</data>
