<node id="Hydrostatischer Spannungszustand">
  <data key="d0">Hydrostatischer Spannungszustand</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Special case 3 of Mohr's stress circle: a hydrostatic stress state, a specific loading condition.&lt;SEP&gt;The German term for the hydrostatic stress state, where all principal normal stresses are equal and shear stresses vanish.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d8ef0753f64ed72eb451c29b8108d08</data>
