</node>
<node id="Umfangsspannungen">
  <data key="d0">Umfangsspannungen</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Circumferential or hoop stresses (σφ) in the wall of a thin-walled cylindrical vessel, derived from force equilibrium in the vertical direction. They are twice the longitudinal stresses (σφ = 2·σx).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784900562</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zylindrischer Kessel">
  <data key="d0">Zylindrischer Kessel</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A thin-walled cylindrical vessel characterized by radius and wall thickness, analyzed under internal or external pressure to determine longitudinal and circumferential stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003</data>
