  <data key="d2">A thin-walled spherical vessel considered for stress analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A German term for spherical boiler used in the surrounding text to refer to the thin-walled spherical pressure vessel.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35913765c2d7101f6d284ecd039952ce</data>
