<node id="Versagen Durch Rissbildung In Längsrichtung">
  <data key="d0">Versagen Durch Rissbildung In Längsrichtung</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The specific failure mode of a thin-walled cylindrical vessel caused by the circumferential stress being twice the longitudinal stress, resulting in longitudinal cracks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-003</data>
