<node id="Selbstrechenübungsgruppen Schedule - Technische Mechanik (Summer Semester) (table)">
  <data key="d0">Selbstrechenübungsgruppen Schedule - Technische Mechanik (Summer Semester) (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table lists the six weekly Selbstrechenübung (self-study exercise) groups for the Technische Mechanik course at RWTH Aachen, starting 29.04.26. Groups 1-3 meet Wednesdays at R5 (Templergraben 51) and Groups 4-6 meet Fridays at HKW 1 (Wüllnerstraße 1), each session lasting 90 minutes. It directly implements the organizational information about offering six limited-capacity exercise groups requiring Moodle registration.</data>
