<node id="Conceptual Overview of Stress State Topics (image)">
  <data key="d0">Conceptual Overview of Stress State Topics (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image serves as an introductory visual for Chapter 11 of a German engineering mechanics textbook, focusing on the state of stress (Spannungszustand). By arranging Scrabble tiles to spell 'LEARN', the graphic introduces five core analytical tools and concepts: the stress tensor, plane stress state, principal axes, principal stresses, and Mohr's circle. These elements represent the progression of topics covered in the chapter following the initial definition of stress vectors and tensors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dbabf4bbc38075b362efc1cf68c92ba</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
