<node id="Lernziele (Learning Objectives) Section Header (header)">
  <data key="d0">Lernziele (Learning Objectives) Section Header (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header introduces the 'Learning Objectives' (Lernziele) section within a German engineering textbook on Technical Mechanics (Technische Mechanik 2: Elastostatik). It serves as a pedagogical transition from the front matter to the core technical instruction, setting the stage for readers to understand the upcoming complex topics on stress analysis, such as stress vectors and tensors detailed in the subsequent pages.</data>
