<node id="Extremum Condition for Principal Stresses (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Extremum Condition for Principal Stresses (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This stationarity condition (dσ/dφ = 0) identifies the cutting angles φ* at which normal stresses reach extremal values—the principal stresses σ₁ and σ₂. It connects to the eigenvalue problem of the stress tensor, where shear stresses simultaneously vanish, yielding the principal directions central to failure analysis in continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28e8a589d6ecd831cc0e1afc0b83e4bc</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
</node>
<node id="Normal Stress Transformation Equation (Ebener Spannungszustand) (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Normal Stress Transformation Equation (Ebener Spannungszustand) (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">Transforms normal stress σ_ξ under coordinate rotation by angle φ in plane stress. Combines mean stress with deviatoric and shear contributions via trigonometric functions. Fundamental for deriving principal stresses and directions, forming the analytical basis for Mohr's circle and failure analysis in continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3780797c1d45f39538f2b68c98e007f0</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
</node>
<node id="Stationarity Condition for Principal Stress Directions (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Stationarity Condition for Principal Stress Directions (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation sets the derivative of the transformed normal stress σ_ξ with respect to the rotation angle φ to zero, yielding the principal directions (Hauptrichtungen). Solving tan(2φ*) = 2τ_xy/(σ_x - σ_y) gives the orientations where normal stresses reach extrema (σ_1, σ_2) and shear stress vanishes, forming the analytical core of Mohr's circle theory in plane stress analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97ae2381cfa6e993a16166b7495765c3</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
</node>
