  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">An identity verification within the principal stress (Hauptspannungen) derivation, demonstrating that the defined sin(2φ*) and cos(2φ*) expressions satisfy the Pythagorean normalization sin²+cos²=1, ensuring consistency of the principal direction angle φ* where shear stress τξη vanishes and normal stresses σ₁, σ₂ attain extremal values.</data>
