  <data key="d0">Page 32 (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number marker '32' for a mechanical engineering document page. It anchors the 'Zusammenfassung' (Summary) of Chapter 11, which synthesizes critical concepts regarding stress states, including stress tensors, Mohr's stress circle, transformation relations, principal stresses, and equilibrium conditions.</data>
