<node id="Extreme Shear Stresses">
  <data key="d0">Extreme Shear Stresses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Also known as Hauptschubspannungen, representing extreme values of shear stresses discussed within stress transformation theory.&lt;SEP&gt;Also known as Hauptschubspannungen, these are the stresses visualized and determined using Mohr's Stress Circle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8e6a6756f3e11958caa7f25916a94bb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-350755d5c7a3a740e91d107394468b5c</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
