<node id="Coordinate Rotation">
  <data key="d0">Coordinate Rotation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The operation of rotating the coordinate system using trigonometric identities, central to stress tensor transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;The transformation under which the component values of the stress tensor change while the physical state remains invariant.&lt;SEP&gt;The transformation of the coordinate system under which the stress tensor invariants I₁ and I₂ remain constant.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd1f71b01c1aa5c67c36a16a597748fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68094852a469c1054fde9d0f452e6077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0658f7561c12b0a53196517bdee01443</data>
