<node id="Diameter">
  <data key="d0">Diameter</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A solid black line segment connecting points P and P', passing directly through the circle's center, $\sigma_M$.&lt;SEP&gt;The total diameter of the closed cylinder, denoted as 2r, representing a key geometric parameter of the pressure vessel.</data>
