  <data key="d0">Double-index Notation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A notation method used for the description of stress states through coordinate planes.&lt;SEP&gt;A notation system for stresses using two indices, introduced in previous content before the simplified single-index notation.</data>
