</node>
<node id="2D Continuum Mechanics">
  <data key="d0">2D Continuum Mechanics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The branch of mechanics dealing with the mechanical behavior of materials modeled as a continuous mass rather than as discrete particles, specifically in two dimensions&lt;SEP&gt;The field of mechanics in which the Cauchy stress tensor and its fundamental transformation equations are applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-792f1aab7b01df3f4ae8fa499208a41a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb966affea49c8515afe80d893d4ba39</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Double-Angle Form">
  <data key="d0">Double-Angle Form</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The mathematical form of the stress transformation equation obtained using trigonometric identities involving double angles such as cos2φ and sin2φ</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-792f1aab7b01df3f4ae8fa499208a41a</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thin-Walled Structure">
  <data key="d0">Thin-Walled Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A structural component from which the differential material element or infinitesimal volume is derived.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb31546e781f11ba51b9575be2e9cb66</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tensile Normal Stresses">
  <data key="d0">Tensile Normal Stresses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mechanical loads acting upon the differential element, indicated by four thick red arrows originating from the midpoints of the square's sides and pointing radially outward.&lt;SEP&gt;Stresses signified by four thick red arrows originating from the midpoints of each side of the square and pointing outward in the diagram.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb31546e781f11ba51b9575be2e9cb66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-153ac624cdef095260ab75841c027b8f</data>
