  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tangential Stress ($\sigma_t$)">
  <data key="d0">Tangential Stress ($\sigma_t$)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Also referred to as meridional stress, it is represented by the vertical pair of arrows labeled with the Greek symbol sigma subscript t ($\sigma_t$).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb31546e781f11ba51b9575be2e9cb66</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Circumferential Stress ($\sigma_\varphi$)">
  <data key="d0">Circumferential Stress ($\sigma_\varphi$)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Also referred to as hoop stress, it is represented by the horizontal pair of arrows labeled with the Greek symbol sigma subscript phi ($\sigma_\varphi$).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb31546e781f11ba51b9575be2e9cb66</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thin-Walled Vessel ('Dünnwandiger Kessel')">
  <data key="d0">Thin-Walled Vessel ('Dünnwandiger Kessel')</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of vessel mentioned in the surrounding context of the diagram.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb31546e781f11ba51b9575be2e9cb66</data>
