  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A spherical vessel subject to internal pressure, analyzed through a differential section of its shell to determine membrane stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A kugelförmiger Kessel (spherical vessel) characterized as thin-walled, subjected to internal pressure and mechanical stress.&lt;SEP&gt;A spherical pressure vessel (dünnwandiger Kugelkessel) with wall thickness much smaller than the radius (t ≪ r), subjected to internal or external pressure, for which the equilibrium equation is derived.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8ec6927ab0bb507f573af8049b45847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73adfabedf760785acfd7b799786f369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bd1d5444d931cb0efa80cdff770977</data>
