<node id="Maximum Principal Stress">
  <data key="d0">Maximum Principal Stress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The intersection of Mohr's Circle with the horizontal axis, labeled as $\sigma_1$, representing the maximum principal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;The extremal maximum normal stress value (σ₁) occurring on the principal plane oriented at the principal angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-341774a38a3b4fd47c6656391af81dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cae0fdb4f5af9a553af5e5ec7a633b8</data>
