<node id="Angle $\varphi$">
  <data key="d0">Angle $\varphi$</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The angle by which the new coordinate system $(\xi, \eta)$ is rotated relative to the original system $(x, y)$.&lt;SEP&gt;The physical rotation angle of the coordinate system element, which corresponds to a rotation of $2\varphi$ on Mohr's Circle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-341774a38a3b4fd47c6656391af81dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30fd62b02c985c73748d5224a5c1f6aa</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
