<node id="Provided Equation">
  <data key="d0">Provided Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A finite scalar product expressed in LaTeX format where each multiplicand takes the form of an additive inverse (1/2 - 1/2), causing the entire expression to evaluate exactly to zero by the zero-product property.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical expression consisting of a chain of equalities utilizing basic arithmetic operations on rational constants, identified as mathematically inconsistent and likely an artifact of severe Optical Character Recognition corruption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68094852a469c1054fde9d0f452e6077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b47aa4fc45ad067947c357da574f854</data>
