  <data key="d2">The English translation of 'Spannungszustand', representing the primary focus of Chapter 11.&lt;SEP&gt;The physical state of a material that is calculated using transformation equations on an arbitrary plane.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68094852a469c1054fde9d0f452e6077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dbabf4bbc38075b362efc1cf68c92ba</data>
