<node id="Resultant Force">
  <data key="d0">Resultant Force</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The force exerted by internal pressure p acting on the projected circular area πr², represented as p · π · r² on the right-hand side of the equilibrium equation&lt;SEP&gt;The total force acting on the vessel wall, specifically represented by σ_φ · 2πrt, derived from the hoop stress acting over the cross-sectional annular area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-493acae899ca4eaaedf536afa97f481b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73adfabedf760785acfd7b799786f369</data>
