</node>
<node id="Longitudinal Cracking">
  <data key="d0">Longitudinal Cracking</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A typical failure mode for pressure vessels occurring perpendicular to the larger principal stress (circumferential stress).&lt;SEP&gt;A failure mode in pressure vessels (Rissbildung in Längsrichtung) that can be prevented by accurately predicting wall stresses using the vessel formula</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-493acae899ca4eaaedf536afa97f481b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee3c8346d073a8fddaf35535eb1158c</data>
