<node id="Spherical Pressure Vessel Equilibrium Equation">
  <data key="d0">Spherical Pressure Vessel Equilibrium Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical equation representing the equilibrium condition for a thin-walled spherical pressure vessel subjected to internal or external pressure, derived from a vertical force balance on a hemispherical section, yielding the hoop stress formula σ_φ = (1/2)·p·r/t.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73adfabedf760785acfd7b799786f369</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904014</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vertical Force Balance">
  <data key="d0">Vertical Force Balance</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The method (Kräftegleichgewicht in vertikaler Richtung) of deriving the equilibrium equation by balancing vertical forces on a hemispherical section of the vessel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73adfabedf760785acfd7b799786f369</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904014</data>
