  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The force exerted by the vessel wall against internal pressure, represented on the left-hand side of the longitudinal stress equation.&lt;SEP&gt;The force generated by the wall stresses that counteracts the pressure force to maintain equilibrium.</data>
