</node>
<node id="Principal Stress Sigma 2">
  <data key="d0">Principal Stress Sigma 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The minimum principal stress (Hauptspannung), with σ_1 &gt; σ_2, attained at the principal directions; governs material yielding, fracture, and stability.</data>
