  <data key="d2">The transformation of stresses (Koordinatentransformation, section 11.2.1) linked to the determination of principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic in stress analysis involving the transformation of stress components between coordinate systems, also referred to as Koordinatentransformation, covered in the educational content sourced from 'Technische Mechanik 2'.</data>
