  <data key="d2">The symbol labeling two of the red arrows in the diagram, representing the magnitude of the applied uniaxial tensile stress.&lt;SEP&gt;The scalar value (σ_0) representing the equal principal normal stresses in the hydrostatic stress state and serving as the coordinate of the degenerated Mohr's circle point.</data>
