  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The angle that characterizes the orientation of arbitrarily oriented cutting planes.&lt;SEP&gt;The angle denoted by the Greek letter phi, formed between the bottom edge of the tilted square and a solid black horizontal reference line, representing the rotation of the observation plane.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-153ac624cdef095260ab75841c027b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f298ccb33e1f76a031a29e81e1f9dd</data>
