<node id="Principal Stress Direction">
  <data key="d0">Principal Stress Direction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The angle, denoted as φ*, defining the principal stress orientation, related to the stress components by the equation tan 2φ* = 2τ_xy/(σ_x - σ_y).&lt;SEP&gt;The reference direction relative to which the observation plane is rotated by the angle phi.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-153ac624cdef095260ab75841c027b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6589bf554e5066ac0fa2960ba8d673c0</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904048</data>
