  <data key="d2">The plane orientation defining the principal stress direction, from which the planes of maximum shear stress are offset by 45 degrees.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6589bf554e5066ac0fa2960ba8d673c0</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
