  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The maximum shear stress magnitude expressed as τ_max = |σ₁ - σ₂| / 2, relating to principal stresses in the principal axis system&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum shear stress in a thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessel under internal pressure, calculated as (1/4)·p·r/t, occurring on planes oriented at 45° to the principal stress directions</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd747436c8f7ae4c9f1ad317397dda30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e4d70cf188ab298b97a6d1cf9e80c8</data>
