  <data key="d0">Plane Stress Condition (ESZ)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A fundamental assumption in thin-walled pressure vessel analysis stating that radial stresses are negligible due to a high radius-to-thickness ratio (t ≪ r).</data>
