  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A theoretical framework discussed on page 21 of the material, covering principal stresses, principal axis system, extreme values of shear stresses, and normal stresses in sections of extreme shear stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-350755d5c7a3a740e91d107394468b5c</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
