<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Tensile Stress">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Tensile Stress is a type of Normal Stress designated as positive in the sign convention.&lt;SEP&gt;Positive values of normal stress indicate tensile stress (Zugspannung) in tension/compression members.&lt;SEP&gt;Tensile stress is a specific type of normal stress that occurs under pulling forces.</data>
  <data key="d9">includes,indicates,positive values,sign convention,subtype</data>
