</edge>
<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Compressive Stress">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Compressive Stress is a type of Normal Stress designated as negative in the sign convention.&lt;SEP&gt;Negative values of normal stress indicate compressive stress (Druckspannung) in tension/compression members.&lt;SEP&gt;Compressive stress is a specific type of normal stress that occurs under pushing forces.</data>
  <data key="d9">includes,indicates,negative values,sign convention,subtype</data>
