<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Stress Tensor">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The normal stresses form the main diagonal components of the stress tensor&lt;SEP&gt;Normal stress is a component of the stress state described by the stress tensor.&lt;SEP&gt;Normal stress components sigma_xx, sigma_yy, and sigma_zz are integral parts of the stress tensor acting on faces perpendicular to the x, y, and z axes respectively&lt;SEP&gt;The stress tensor contains three normal stresses (σ_xx, σ_yy, σ_zz) on its main diagonal.&lt;SEP&gt;The stress tensor includes normal stress components σx and σy as part of its entries.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,components,composition,consists of,contains,includes,main diagonal</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf5f754cbb16f87120d0c3bf0cd2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-012508b359d5f14b7a687dd269f97c12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d97fb385691a70a5c314b2a77a107e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3409eb9a461816c78110bf52f37f07</data>
  <data key="d11">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
