<edge source="Strain" target="Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hooke's Law connects stress analysis to strain (Dehnung) and elastic deformation behavior&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's Law establishes the constitutive relationship between stress and strain in the linear-elastic region.&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law σ = E·ε is used to determine strain&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law σ = E·ε relates stress to strain through the material stiffness&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law (σ = Eε) relates stress to strain.</data>
  <data key="d9">connects,determines,governs,relates</data>
