</edge>
<edge source="Verschiebung" target="Einzelstab">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The section on Einzelstab bridges statically determinate/indeterminate systems analysis with differential equations for bar displacement (Verschiebung).&lt;SEP&gt;Displacement is a key mechanical property analyzed within the Einzelstab theoretical discussion.</data>
  <data key="d9">analysis,derivation,involves</data>
