<edge source="Statically Determinate Systems" target="Statically Indeterminate Systems">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Section 10.4 progresses from statically determinate rod problems to statically indeterminate rod problems, with page 19 falling between these examples.&lt;SEP&gt;Statically indeterminate systems require the simultaneous solution of equilibrium, constitutive law, and kinematics, whereas statically determinate systems allow for sequential solving.</data>
