<edge source="Gross" target="Technische Mechanik 2">
  <data key="d7">47.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Gross, Technische Mechanik 2) establishes the authorship connection between the individual Gross and the academic textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2". Across the various descriptions provided, there is a unanimous consensus that Gross is a credited author of this specific educational text. While some descriptions broadly refer to Gross simply as an author, the vast majority specifically identify him as a co-author. This indicates that while Gross is definitively listed as a writer of the textbook, the work was a collaborative effort involving multiple contributors. Specifically, it is noted that Gross is one of the four co-authors who collaborated on the book.

Additionally, the descriptions provide a temporal context for this authorial relationship, noting that Gross co-authored an edition of the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2" that was published in the year 2017. In summary, this relation definitively documents Gross's fundamental role as a contributing writer and one of four co-authors of the 2017 publication of the academic work.</data>
  <data key="d9">Author,Publication,author,author of,authored,authored by,authorship,co-author,publication,written by,wrote</data>
