<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Schröder">
  <data key="d7">47.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Schröder and "Technische Mechanik 2" establishes Schröder as a key contributor and academic authority connected to this educational work. Specifically, Schröder is consistently identified as an author, and more precisely, a co-author of the textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2." He is notably recognized as being one of the four co-authors responsible for the creation of this academic material.

Furthermore, records indicate that a notable edition of "Technische Mechanik 2," which was co-authored by Schröder, was published in the year 2017. This comprehensive association confirms Schröder's definitive role in writing, compiling, and contributing to the instructional content found within the textbook.</data>
