<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Wall">
  <data key="d7">47.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Technische Mechanik 2, Wall) designates the professional and academic association between Wall and the textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2." Within the context of this relation, Wall is explicitly identified as an author and co-author of the specified textbook. The varying descriptions consistently establish that Wall played a credited role in the writing and compilation of this educational material. 

Furthermore, the collaborative nature of the authorship is noted, with Wall being recognized as one of the four co-authors of the textbook. Alongside this collaborative role, the specific detail is provided that this textbook was published in the year 2017. Ultimately, this relation serves to document Wall's verified contribution to the creation and publication of "Technische Mechanik 2."</data>
