<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Elastostatics">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Elastostatics and "Technische Mechanik 2" establishes the textbook's fundamental role in focusing on, exploring, and covering the subject of elastostatics. Typically recognized as Volume 2 of its series, the content of "Technische Mechanik 2" specifically belongs to the elastostatics domain within the broader engineering curriculum. 

The textbook is explicitly utilized to facilitate the deeper study and exploration of elastostatics. It provides comprehensive coverage of the subject matter, ensuring that readers can advance their understanding of the field beyond basic principles. By offering dedicated reference material on various elastostatics topics, "Technische Mechanik 2" serves as a primary reference and an essential educational guide for individuals seeking an in-depth resource on the discipline.</data>
