<edge source="Governing ODE For Axial Displacement" target="Constitutive Relation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The governing ODE is derived by substituting the constitutive relation N = E·A·(u' - α_T·ΔT) into the equilibrium condition.</data>
