<edge source="Hanging Bar Under Self-Weight" target="Kinematic Constitutive Relationship For Axial Deformation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The hanging bar under self-weight is an example where the governing differential equation is integrated to obtain the displacement field.</data>
  <data key="d9">example of,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0f197243eeecfe8da4e162edc85af353</data>
  <data key="d11">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
