<edge source="Finite Element Formulation" target="Differential Equation dN/dx + n = 0">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The differential equilibrium equation establishes the mathematical foundation for the finite element formulation of bar elements.</data>
  <data key="d9">basis of,foundation for</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-413d03b5c0b6ff01a4da279c609d09f9</data>
