<edge source="n" target="G">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The distributed line load n is computed as n = G/l, where G is the total weight of the bar.&lt;SEP&gt;The distributed load n is calculated by dividing the total weight G by the length l of the bar.</data>
