<edge source="Kinematic Compatibility Condition" target="Bar Forces">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Combined with equilibrium conditions and Hooke's law, the kinematic compatibility condition allows the determination of all unknown bar forces.</data>
