<edge source="Temperature Change ΔT" target="Governing Differential Equation E·A·u''(x) + n(x) − E·A·α·ΔT' = 0">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The governing differential equation incorporates the temperature change ΔT as a thermal loading parameter.</data>
  <data key="d9">contains,parameter</data>
