  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Differential Segment" target="dx+(u+du)-u">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The mathematical expression represents the calculation for the new deformed length of the differential element.</data>
  <data key="d9">calculates deformed length of</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ba3dc6bb30208edf4354dd20376fa9f6</data>
  <data key="d11">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
