<edge source="Compatibility Equation" target="Small Displacements">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The derivation of the compatibility equation relies on the assumption of small displacements where circular arcs can be replaced by tangents.</data>
  <data key="d9">assumes,relies on</data>
