<edge source="Wahre Querschnittsfläche" target="Ortsabhängig Veränderliche Querschnittsfläche">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Both concepts address how cross-sectional area changes during deformation, with the true area being the actual area at a given deformation state.</data>
  <data key="d9">related_concept</data>
