<edge source="Cauchy Stress Tensor" target="Normal Stresses">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Normal stresses are the diagonal components (σ_xx, σ_yy, σ_zz) of the Cauchy stress tensor where both indices coincide.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cauchy stress tensor contains normal stresses as its main diagonal components&lt;SEP&gt;The principal diagonal of the Cauchy stress tensor contains the normal stresses.</data>
