</edge>
<edge source="Cauchy Stress Tensor" target="Cauchy's Second Law">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Cauchy's second law establishes the symmetry of the Cauchy stress tensor, reducing its nine components to six independent ones.&lt;SEP&gt;Cauchy's second law of angular momentum conservation confirms that the stress tensor is symmetric.&lt;SEP&gt;Cauchy's second law dictates the symmetry of the Cauchy stress tensor, making τ_xy equal to τ_yx.</data>
  <data key="d9">characterized by,governed by,governs,law,symmetry</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7c2c59e0f6a23f968e67f68fc9498278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f298ccb33e1f76a031a29e81e1f9dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95309ae773a0c5fe9703868d35942eff</data>
