<edge source="Hydrostatic Stress State" target="Schematic Diagram">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The schematic diagram specifically illustrates Special Case 3: the hydrostatic stress state, where normal stresses are equal in all directions and shear stress is zero.</data>
  <data key="d9">depicts,illustrates</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-98ff466f481e3ef48f03b583574686cc</data>
  <data key="d11">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
