  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Principal directions are the specific angles at which the principal stresses occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Principal stresses are found at the principal directions where normal stresses reach extremal values&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum and minimum normal stresses σ1 and σ2 are found in the principal directions</data>
