<edge source="Principal Stresses" target="Mohr's Stress Circle">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Mohr's Stress Circle serves as a graphical alternative to the analytical calculations of principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohr's Stress Circle is a graphical method used to visualize and determine Principal Stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohr's Stress Circle is used to identify principal stresses as extreme normal stress values at a point on a disk.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohr's Stress Circle is used for the graphical determination of principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;The methodology of Mohr's Stress Circle involves the determination of principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohr's Stress Circle is used to determine the principal stresses from a given plane stress state.</data>
  <data key="d9">alternative to,analysis,calculates,complements,determination,determines,graphical determination,identification,visualizes</data>
