<edge source="Thin-Walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Internal Pressure (p)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Internal pressure acts inside the thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessel, radiating outward from the center of the wall.</data>
