  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Thin-Walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Boiler Formula">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The boiler formula is fundamental in the design of thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessels.</data>
  <data key="d9">designed with,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1ee3c8346d073a8fddaf35535eb1158c</data>
