<edge source="Wall Thickness (t)" target="Thin-walled Pressure Vessel">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The wall thickness t is a defining parameter of thin-walled pressure vessels, assumed to be much smaller than the radius r (t &lt;&lt; r)</data>
