  <data key="d12">1784904201</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Wall Thickness (t)" target="Vessel Radius (r)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Wall thickness t is much smaller than vessel radius r (t ≪ r), justifying the thin-wall approximation and the neglect of radial stresses</data>
